==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hatsune Miku (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[MikuBear]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

